A scoped Max Delay Datapath Only timing constraint is set between clocks clk_fpga_0 and rx_clk (see constraint position 51 in the Timing Constraint window in Vivado IDE). It is not recommended to define such scoped constraints between clocks as the constraint impacts timing paths outside of the scope.
